   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Becoming something",
     "texto": [
      "With a noun, **되다** means becoming something: 의사 → **의사가 되다** (to become a doctor), 어른 → **어른이 되다** (to become an adult), 선생님 → **선생님이 되고 싶어요** (I want to be a teacher).",
      "나중에 **의사가 되고 싶어요** = I want to be a doctor in the future."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With -고 싶다",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about what you want to be, use **-이/가 되고 싶어요**.",
      "통역사가 되고 싶어요 = I want to be an interpreter."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
